    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Metastases:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tx depends on the extent; w solitary or very few colorectal metastases, "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "surg resection may prolong survival"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "; systemic chemo may shrink tumors and prolong life but = ⍉curative"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Liver radiation occasionally relieves severe pain from advanced metastases but does ⍉prolong life; extensive dz = fatal and = best managed by palliation and family support"
     }
    ]
